  "title": "GPGI Appoints 30-Year Veteran Robert Domodossola as President and CEO of Husky",
  "summary": "BOLTON, Ontario, March 02, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — GPGI, Inc. (NYSE: GPGI) today announced the appointment of 30-year company veteran Robert Domodossola as President and Chief Executive Officer of Husky Technologies™ (“Husky” or the “Company”), effective immediately. This strategic selection positions a proven leader to accelerate the company’s global growth and enhance operational excellence through […]",
